WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.424 --> 00:00:03.942
Unit seven. Turning On a Tablet!

2
00:00:04.883 --> 00:00:09.769
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.819 --> 00:00:13.022
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.072 --> 00:00:17.142
Today we learn about Turning On a Tablet. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.497 --> 00:00:22.364
Tablet. Say it with me. Tablet!

6
00:00:25.912 --> 00:00:29.603
Button. Say it with me. Button!

7
00:00:33.122 --> 00:00:36.922
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

8
00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:44.190
Power. Say it with me. Power!

9
00:00:47.655 --> 00:00:51.355
Turn on. Say it with me. Turn on!

10
00:00:54.909 --> 00:00:58.867
Icon. Say it with me. Icon!

11
00:01:02.345 --> 00:01:05.911
Tap. Say it with me. Tap!

12
00:01:09.411 --> 00:01:12.961
Home. Say it with me. Home!

13
00:01:16.488 --> 00:01:25.331
I turn on a tablet by pressing the power button. The screen lights up and shows icons. I tap an icon to open an app.

14
00:01:25.381 --> 00:01:28.446
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:29.186 --> 00:01:34.500
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:35.700
Screen!

17
00:01:36.755 --> 00:01:42.080
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:43.280
Tap!

19
00:01:44.192 --> 00:01:50.475
Did you know? The first tablet computers were invented decades before the ones we use today!

20
00:01:50.525 --> 00:01:52.806
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:53.877 --> 00:02:02.481
Think and answer. What do you tap to open an app on a tablet?

22
00:02:02.531 --> 00:02:03.704
Great answer!

23
00:02:04.711 --> 00:02:10.649
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:10.699 --> 00:02:13.858
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

